{"id": "f232b371-4665-40ad-85db-449c58bb5bc5", "slug": "immersive-worlds", "title": "Immersive Worlds", "description": "Immersive Worlds UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Immersive Worlds\"\ndescription: \"Immersive Worlds UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#000000\"\n  secondary: \"#F8F7F4\"\n  accent: \"#000000\"\n  background: \"#000000\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Playfair Display\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Immersive Worlds\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 3; favorites: 0; remixes: 0.\nTags: dashboard, charts, bento, animated, effect, webgl.\n## Overview\nImmersive Worlds UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nÆ The Obsidian Citadel Where ancient shadows embrace the dawn, a new era awaits in silence. Æ The Celestial Haven Suspended in the quiet breath of the atmosphere, untouched by time.\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: The Obsidian Citadel; The Celestial Haven.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #000000, secondary #F8F7F4, accent #000000, background #000000, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Playfair Display for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Immersive Worlds</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400&amp;family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;1,400&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body style=\"background-color: #F8F7F4; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\" class=\"antialiased relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-6 md:p-12 selection:bg-black selection:text-white\">\n\n    <!-- Abstract Background Lines Animation -->\n    <canvas id=\"bg-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 opacity-[0.15]\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Main Container -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-[1000px] mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center\">\n\n        <!-- Card 1 -->\n        <article class=\"card-trigger group relative flex flex-col bg-black rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden shadow-[0_30px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] h-[600px] lg:h-[700px] transition-transform duration-[1s] ease-out hover:-translate-y-2\">\n\n            <!-- Image Area -->\n            <div class=\"relative h-[65%] w-full overflow-hidden\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1643293383951-0755fda59471?ixid=M3w3NTc5NzN8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHw2fHxmdXR1cmlzdGljJTIwY2l0YWRlbHxlbnwxfDF8fHwxNzczMzc3OTU3fDA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;w=1600&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Sci-Fi Citadel\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-[2s] ease-out group-hover:scale-105\">\n\n                <!-- Center Logo/Monogram -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none\">\n                    <span style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\" class=\"text-white text-4xl tracking-widest opacity-90 drop-shadow-lg\">Æ</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Fade to Black Gradient -->\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 h-3/4 bg-gradient-to-t from-black via-black/80 to-transparent\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Text Area -->\n            <div class=\"relative flex-1 bg-black p-8 lg:p-12 flex flex-col justify-end\">\n                <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\" class=\"text-white text-2xl lg:text-3xl tracking-tight mb-5 font-normal\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">The</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">Obsidian</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full italic\">Citadel</span></span>\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light max-w-[95%]\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">Where</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">ancient</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">shadows</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">embrace</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">the</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">dawn,</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">a</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">new</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">era</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">awaits</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">in</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">silence.</span></span>\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <!-- Card 2 -->\n        <article class=\"card-trigger group relative flex flex-col bg-black rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden shadow-[0_30px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] h-[600px] lg:h-[700px] transition-transform duration-[1s] ease-out hover:-translate-y-2 md:translate-y-8\">\n\n            <!-- Image Area -->\n            <div class=\"relative h-[65%] w-full overflow-hidden\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518709268805-4e9042af9f23?q=80&amp;w=1500&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop\" alt=\"Floating Sanctuary\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-[2s] ease-out group-hover:scale-105\">\n\n                <!-- Center Logo/Monogram -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none\">\n                    <span style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\" class=\"text-white text-4xl tracking-widest opacity-90 drop-shadow-lg\">Æ</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Fade to Black Gradient -->\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 h-3/4 bg-gradient-to-t from-black via-black/80 to-transparent\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Text Area -->\n            <div class=\"relative flex-1 bg-black p-8 lg:p-12 flex flex-col justify-end\">\n                <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\" class=\"text-white text-2xl lg:text-3xl tracking-tight mb-5 font-normal\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">The</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">Celestial</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full italic\">Haven</span></span>\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light max-w-[95%]\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">Suspended</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">in</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">the</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">quiet</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">breath</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">of</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">the</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">atmosphere,</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">untouched</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">by</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top\"><span class=\"word-inner block transform translate-y-full\">time.</span></span>\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </article>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // GSAP ScrollTrigger Masked Word Reveal\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        document.querySelectorAll('.card-trigger').forEach((card) => {\n            const words = card.querySelectorAll('.word-inner');\n\n            gsap.to(words, {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.04,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: card,\n                    start: \"top 85%\",\n                }\n            });\n        });\n\n        // Background Canvas Line Network (Agency Style)\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('bg-canvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n        let width, height;\n        let particles = [];\n\n        function resize() {\n            width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n            height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n        }\n\n        class Particle {\n            constructor() {\n                this.x = Math.random() * width;\n                this.y = Math.random() * height;\n                this.vx = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.3;\n                this.vy = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.3;\n                this.radius = Math.random() * 1.5 + 0.5;\n            }\n\n            update() {\n                this.x += this.vx;\n                this.y += this.vy;\n\n                if (this.x < 0 || this.x > width) this.vx *= -1;\n                if (this.y < 0 || this.y > height) this.vy *= -1;\n            }\n\n            draw() {\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.arc(this.x, this.y, this.radius, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                ctx.fillStyle = '#000000';\n                ctx.fill();\n            }\n        }\n\n        function initCanvas() {\n            resize();\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n            const particleCount = Math.floor(window.innerWidth / 15);\n            for (let i = 0; i < particleCount; i++) {\n                particles.push(new Particle());\n            }\n            animate();\n        }\n\n        function animate() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < particles.length; i++) {\n                particles[i].update();\n                particles[i].draw();\n\n                for (let j = i; j < particles.length; j++) {\n                    const dx = particles[i].x - particles[j].x;\n                    const dy = particles[i].y - particles[j].y;\n                    const distance = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);\n\n                    if (distance < 120) {\n                        ctx.beginPath();\n                        ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(0, 0, 0, ${0.2 - distance / 600})`;\n                        ctx.lineWidth = 0.5;\n                        ctx.moveTo(particles[i].x, particles[i].y);\n                        ctx.lineTo(particles[j].x, particles[j].y);\n                        ctx.stroke();\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n        }\n\n        initCanvas();\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "immersive-worlds.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/immersive-worlds.jpg", "source_name": "immersive-worlds-DESIGN.md", "views": 91, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T01:49:11.667807+00:00"}